{"id":"hardfork-tech-right-midterms-2026-11-06","title":"Why the Tech Right Lost Big This Week","guest":"Erin Griffith；Ezra Klein；Theodore Schleifer；主持 Max Read","show":"Hard Fork","date":"2026-11-06","duration":"68分钟","category":"VC·基建·市场","topics":["policy-geopolitics","compute-infra","markets-vc","society-work"],"priority":"P1","summary":"Hard Fork 在历史性中期选举后请来纽约时报科技记者 Erin Griffith 与专栏作者 Ezra Klein，讨论结果对科技行业意味着什么：反 AI 与反数据中心情绪扮演的角色、对亿万富翁的反弹，以及硅谷是否正在经历一场离开 Tech Right 的氛围转变。Max Read 另与报道亿万富翁政治影响的 Theodore Schleifer 为科技超级捐款人排座次。补充阅读指向时报关于科技富豪在民主党横扫后的政治处境、特斯拉/SpaceX 股价波动，以及加密货币在俄亥俄等地的失利等报道。","advice":"关心选举后科技政治、数据中心选址舆论与「Tech Right」叙事的人听。主体是时政分析，AI/数据中心是其中一条明确主线，不是模型访谈。","urls":[{"label":"NYT Hard Fork 栏目","href":"https://www.nytimes.com/column/hard-fork"},{"label":"Audio","href":"https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/pdst.fm/e/pfx.vpixl.com/6qj4J/pscrb.fm/rss/p/tracking.swap.fm/track/4jdbJYYRKqK96EGqOzQb/nyt.simplecastaudio.com/3e43d072-f8a5-430f-bc8e-4c70aafdf3c7/episodes/38bdaf0f-4886-47b2-82d6-15ecf803abbf/audio/128/default.mp3?aid=rss_feed&awCollectionId=3e43d072-f8a5-430f-bc8e-4c70aafdf3c7&awEpisodeId=38bdaf0f-4886-47b2-82d6-15ecf803abbf&feed=6HKOhNgS"}],"addedAt":"2026-11-09","cover":"thumbs/hardfork-tech-right-midterms-2026-11-06.jpg","media":{"audioUrl":"https://dts.podtrac.com/redirect.mp3/pdst.fm/e/pfx.vpixl.com/6qj4J/pscrb.fm/rss/p/tracking.swap.fm/track/4jdbJYYRKqK96EGqOzQb/nyt.simplecastaudio.com/3e43d072-f8a5-430f-bc8e-4c70aafdf3c7/episodes/38bdaf0f-4886-47b2-82d6-15ecf803abbf/audio/128/default.mp3?aid=rss_feed&awCollectionId=3e43d072-f8a5-430f-bc8e-4c70aafdf3c7&awEpisodeId=38bdaf0f-4886-47b2-82d6-15ecf803abbf&feed=6HKOhNgS","audioSource":"podcast-rss"},"hasEssay":false,"hasAnalysis":false,"hasTranscript":false}
